  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Cut the **Chinese honey soy tofu** into 2 cm cubes. Peel and finely grate the **ginger**. **TIP:** Hold the knob in one hand and use the tip of a baby spoon to scrape off the peel. It's easier than using a knife or vegetable peeler! Peel and crush the **garlic**. Finely slice the **red onion**. Slice the **red capsicum** into thin strips. Trim the ends of the **snow peas**. Pick the **coriander** leaves. Finely slice the **long red chilli (if using)**.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/5897f09bb32fbe09d52820c2-0-0-d4cdad9a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rinse the **Jasmine rice** well. Place the rice and the **water (for the rice)** in a medium saucepan and bring to the boil over a high heat. Reduce the heat to medium and simmer, uncovered, for **11-12 minutes**, or until the rice is soft. Drain and return to the saucepan. Cover with a lid to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/5897f09bb32fbe09d52820c2-1-0-29f71268.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the rice is cooking, combine the **hoisin sauce**, **soy sauce**, **rice wine vinegar** and the **warm water (for the sauce)** in a small bowl. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/5897f09bb32fbe09d52820c2-2-0-230d3618.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large wok or frying pan over a high heat. Add a **drizzle** of **olive oil** and the **Chinese honey soy tofu** and cook for **4 minutes**, or until golden. Set aside in a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/5897f09bb32fbe09d52820c2-3-0-4ac3bd4c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return the wok to a high heat and add another **drizzle** of **olive oil**. Add the **garlic** and **ginger** and cook for **2 minutes**, or until golden. Add the **red onion**, **red capsicum** and **snow peas** and stir-fry for **2 minutes**, or until just tender. Return the **tofu** to the wok and add the **hoisin-soy sauce**. Stir-fry for **1 minute**, or until heated through. Remove from the heat and stir through the **coriander**.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/5897f09bb32fbe09d52820c2-4-0-37331d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the Jasmine rice between bowls and top with the tofu and veggie stir-fry. Sprinkle over the long red chilli (if using). **TIP:** Some like it hot but if you don't, just hold back on the chilli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/5897f09bb32fbe09d52820c2-5-0-2b3bda00.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
